      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Would also like to quickly add that those that are in a region where this issue occurs will still pass the birthday validation check if their day of birth is less than 12, however, those that do pass end up with the totally wrong birth date on their account. Something that is currently not modifiable on a Steam account.",
