  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When setting up an account via steam the date of birth field is verified according to the system's set  date format.\nI had a UK date format set on DD/MM/YYYY on my system.\nThe setup did not verify any date where the date in a month exceeded the 12th.\nExample: 11/18/1990\nI changed the system date format to the US date format MM/DD/YYYY and then the setup worked once restarting VR chat.",
